            ("FR-DOC-SCR-007", "The Sub-Registrar may re-calculate stamp duty and fees through the Fee Calculation service; old and new amounts shall be kept in history.", "Must", "Both amounts visible; reason captured"),
            ("FR-DOC-SCR-012", "The checklist shall show every stamp duty input with its source and the Article determination reason; the Sub-Registrar may correct an input with a reason, which re-runs the Article determination and the fee calculation.", "Must", "Old and new input values, Article and amounts kept in history; citizen sees the corrected values"),
