            ("FR-DOC-SCR-009", "Approve: the system shall mark the application Approved for Payment with the final amounts, approve any exemption / denoting claim, release the payment hold and notify the applicant; approval remarks are internal.", "Must", "Remarks not visible on the citizen portal"),
            ("FR-DOC-SCR-010", "Revert: the Sub-Registrar shall give the corrections needed (visible to the applicant); the system shall return the application and notify; the citizen corrects and resubmits.", "Must", "Resubmitted application returns to the same office queue"),
            ("FR-DOC-SCR-011", "Reject: the Sub-Registrar shall record the reason; the system shall close the application and notify the applicant.", "Must", "Rejected application read-only"),
