            ("FR-DOC-APT-003", "A slot after the last date for presentation shall need explicit acknowledgement that a condonation application and delay fine will be needed (Sec. 25; Rule 46).", "Must", "Acknowledgement stored with the booking"),
            ("FR-DOC-APT-004", "The system shall send the appointment confirmation (application number, office, date, time, who and what to bring) by SMS, email and portal.", "Must", "Confirmation downloadable"),
