            ("FR-DOC-WDR-001", "The presenter may submit a signed written withdrawal request with the reason at any time before registration.", "Must", "Request attached to the application"),
            ("FR-DOC-WDR-002", "The Sub-Registrar shall verify the presenter's identity and request, record the withdrawal, date and reason in the Minute Book and approve it with DSC; withdrawal is not a refusal (no Book 2 entry, no Sec. 71(2) block, no appeal).", "Must", "Minute Book entry signed"),
            ("FR-DOC-WDR-003", "Where the document was referred to the District Registrar, the system shall intimate the District Registrar; an impounded document is released only on the District Registrar's order.", "Must", "Referral case updated"),
