            ("FR-DOC-RFD-009", "On allowance the system shall cancel and lock the certificate, compute the duty less 20 paise per rupee (Sec. 51; Rule 32(1)), record the treasury cheque and the register of cancelled certificates, and include it in the monthly report to the CCRA.", "Must", "Certificate cannot be reused after locking"),
