            ("FR-DOC-NTF-001", "The system shall send bilingual SMS / email / portal notifications on submission, revert, rejection, approval for payment, payment, signing links, signing complete, appointment, pending appearance, summons, referral, orders, registration, refusal, withdrawal and refunds.", "Must", "Templates in English and Kannada"),
            ("FR-DOC-NTF-002", "The citizen shall see a status tracker for the application mirroring the status model (7.vii).", "Must", "Current status and next action shown"),
